OL,3,GNEWSAApartment block evacuated after
OL,4,Amajor water leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apartment block in Nottingham has
OL,7,Fbeen evacuated after a major water leak
OL,8,F"significantly compromised" the fire
OL,9,Fsafety of the building.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(NFRS) said it was made aware of the
OL,13,Fleak at Cranbrook House, on Cranbrook
OL,14,FStreet, on Friday and began evacuating
OL,15,Fresidents at about 00:00 BST on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FA total of 60 people have been moved
OL,19,Ffrom the building, according to a
OL,20,Fstatement issued by the fire service
OL,21,Fand Nottingham City Council.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
