OL,3,GNEWSAApartment block evacuated after
OL,4,Amajor water leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were unable to stay with
OL,7,Ffamily or friends spent the night at St
OL,8,FMary's Church on High Pavement, where
OL,9,Fcity council officers and members of
OL,10,Fthe British Red Cross provided support.
